 "summary": {
  "zh": "Be 样 C III 的 24 个能级，按作者 script3_ZF/csfg 缩小到 n = 4，逐层 MCDHF 后计算含 Breit 和 QED 的 CI。多参考组态为 1s²(2s²、2p²、2s3s、2s3d、2s2p、2s3p、2p3s)。零阶空间为冻结 1s² 的价电子单、双激发；完整空间允许 1s 激发，均筛选与多参考相互作用的 CSFG。rcsfgzerofirst_csfg 排序后，rangular_csfg 和 rci_csfg 从 Zero_n4.g 自动取得各块 ICCUT (26、17、34、42、49、41、28)。初始 n = 3 SCF 重复一次，以保存的 n3.w 经 rwfnestimate_csfg 读回，无自定义步骤。",
  "en": "24 levels of Be-like C III, reducing the authors’ script3_ZF/csfg to n = 4: layer-by-layer MCDHF followed by CI with Breit and QED. The multireference is 1s²(2s², 2p², 2s3s, 2s3d, 2s2p, 2s3p, 2p3s). The zero-order space contains valence single and double excitations with frozen 1s²; the full space allows 1s excitations. Both are filtered for interaction with the multireference. After rcsfgzerofirst_csfg reorders the list, rangular_csfg and rci_csfg derive block ICCUT values (26, 17, 34, 42, 49, 41, 28) from Zero_n4.g. The initial n = 3 SCF is repeated using rwfnestimate_csfg to reload saved n3.w; no custom steps."
 },
